|T3.2.3,NESA|T3.6.3,NESA|T3.6.4,NESA|T4.2.1,NESA|T5.1.1,NESA|T5.4.4,NESA|T5.4.5,NESA|T5.5.4,NESA|T5.6.1,NESA|T7.5.1,NESA|T7.5.2,NESA|T7.5.3,NESA|T7.6.3,NESA|T8.2.9,NIAv2|AM3,NIAv2|SM5,NIAv2|SM6,NIAv2|SS29,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.1,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.5,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.5.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|10.3.2,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.3,QCSC-v1|6.2,QCSC-v1|7.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|10.2.1,QCSC-v1|11.2,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-268555r1034605_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-15-005001,SWIFT-CSCv1|6.4,TBA-FIISB|31.1,TBA-FIISB|37.3.3,Vuln-ID|V-268555"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/23761"
      cmd         : "/usr/bin/csrutil status | /usr/bin/grep -c 'System Integrity Protection status: enabled.'"
